# Copy this file to .env.local (which is gitignored) to enable the shared app-token gate.
#
# 1. Pick any long random string and put it here:
# VITE_APP_TOKEN=your-long-random-token
#
# 2. Set the SAME value as a Cloudflare secret (server side):
#    npx wrangler pages secret put APP_GATE_TOKEN
#
# 3. Rebuild and redeploy. Requests without a matching x-app-token header now get 401.
#
# Leave unset (no .env.local) to keep the endpoints open — the per-IP rate limit in
# wrangler.toml (RATE_LIMIT_PER_MIN) still protects against abuse either way.
